<p>Regardless, I like it. As I said in the review, this reminds me (in a good way) of the clockwork robots from <em>Doctor Who</em> S28E4 &quot;The Girl in the Fireplace&quot;, trying to repair a mechanical construct with biological parts. It takes it a step further though, as this is a robot(?) that's trying to become biological (hence &quot;Reverse Cyborg&quot;).</p>
